{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your own friends</h2>You probably won't find anyone online, so make sure to bring a friend!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/268512bd5b3811d37151a51c9eab54d3.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Supernatural mayhem\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/ae30203173c4413e7f481d3953a45066.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"It&#039;s in the shadows\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hide in the shadows and kill your prey one by one!</strong><br>Stalk your prey from a distance and stay as close as possible without being seen. Then strike before they have time to react!<br><br>You're completely invisible in the shadows. Avoid light at all cost!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/b1fe8056167acd5095f020fef55a0043.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Defend yourself\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Use various improvised weapons and gadgets to locate and defend from the monster. </strong><br>Use the right tool at the right time to shift the tides!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/8147c5848e7e4d14c6587a00979d32e6.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Survive and banish it\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Work together to survive and banish the monster once and for all!</strong><br>Don't forget to check the shadows and keep a light source close by, once it decides to attack it's already too late!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/145d0c0ffbac78b67a395cbf76c9987c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"1 monster vs up to 5 humans\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Work with your friends or try to brutally murder them!<br><br>The game supports proximity chat with other effects like echo in certain locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c758ee5727ea488c2faf270faff72919.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Learning curve warning\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Midnight Mayhem has some unique mechanics that take time to master. If you're looking for a simple game you can pick up in a couple minutes, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9c8c7c1148719497ff479f679423ed1c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Join the discord\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Join the Discord using the button on the right side of the page!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity chat<br></li><li>2-6 players<br></li><li>19 Strange monster abilities<br></li><li>5 Maps<br></li><li>5 Main weapons<br></li><li>6 Different gadgets and tools<br></li><li>6 Modulators to switch up the gameplay<br></li><li>11 Unlockable masks to customize your character<br></li><li>Xbox controller support</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete Arsenal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/f0cc958d8f92db4397a2c5199bbd92ace529d307.jpg"},{"name":"Puppet of all trades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/872e82f56cad6dad5362efd829ba15fa57541920.jpg"},{"name":"Paranormal strategist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/4cc7d12ee666a4adf7a2a1cd576f12a6b35bb6b8.jpg"},{"name":"Style points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/482117063940c76c68aa1cea82ff198d56bfc8c3.jpg"},{"name":"Wardrobe full of masks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/fbda4b791bf2e8dd42b7808159059536223f3282.jpg"},{"name":"Sightseeing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/af34713c11c14d6e8e3f324888cd32878c4f56c1.jpg"},{"name":"Changing the rules","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/eab82e10094fa73bca3482f5e728c4fc0530d7a6.jpg"},{"name":"Chaos beyond comprehension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/fcf7250c9e50a954d640a6a49c2ceea87911d9fb.jpg"},{"name":"Marionette hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/b19478dc677186876860e51e923d376a3fe908d6.jpg"},{"name":"Leaving the dirty work to someone else","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2890060/6b23b9494fe165a28bfbd025d2fdb55d310b791d.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2890060?t=1769693681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769693681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/7aa4a9a1c29ed00c589ebe45ce0b15d66558c191/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769693681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/7aa4a9a1c29ed00c589ebe45ce0b15d66558c191/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769693681","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains occasional stylized gore and violent deaths, the most frequent example of this is a very unrealistic and stylized decapitation."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your own friends</h2>You probably won't find anyone online, so make sure to bring a friend!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/268512bd5b3811d37151a51c9eab54d3.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Supernatural mayhem\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/a48128f1b0796018852fb849ab4e62a4.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Be prepared for anything as the monsters abilities keep evolving and changing!</strong><br>The monster player has limited control over their next ability so they will also have to think quickly to make the best use of them!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/ae30203173c4413e7f481d3953a45066.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"It&#039;s in the shadows\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/fc844d773555b5f1c9544b786794f58e.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hide in the shadows and kill your prey one by one!</strong><br>Stalk your prey from a distance and stay as close as possible without being seen. Then strike before they have time to react!<br><br>You're completely invisible in the shadows. Avoid light at all cost!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/b1fe8056167acd5095f020fef55a0043.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Defend yourself\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c85909a96039d80478fb324e76747819.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Use various improvised weapons and gadgets to locate and defend from the monster. </strong><br>Use the right tool at the right time to shift the tides!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/8147c5848e7e4d14c6587a00979d32e6.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Survive and banish it\" width=780 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.poster.avif?t=1769693681\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.webm?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9a0fc5ea0bf84a09f9abb9ff61002e23.mp4?t=1769693681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Work together to survive and banish the monster once and for all!</strong><br>Don't forget to check the shadows and keep a light source close by, once it decides to attack it's already too late!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/145d0c0ffbac78b67a395cbf76c9987c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"1 monster vs up to 5 humans\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Work with your friends or try to brutally murder them!<br><br>The game supports proximity chat with other effects like echo in certain locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/c758ee5727ea488c2faf270faff72919.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Learning curve warning\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Midnight Mayhem has some unique mechanics that take time to master. If you're looking for a simple game you can pick up in a couple minutes, this may not be the game for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/extras/9c8c7c1148719497ff479f679423ed1c.webp?t=1769693681\" alt=\"Join the discord\" width=780 height=38 /></span><br>Join the Discord using the button on the right side of the page!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity chat<br></li><li>2-6 players<br></li><li>19 Strange monster abilities<br></li><li>5 Maps<br></li><li>5 Main weapons<br></li><li>6 Different gadgets and tools<br></li><li>6 Modulators to switch up the gameplay<br></li><li>11 Unlockable masks to customize your character<br></li><li>Xbox controller support</li></ul>","developers":["Gradient Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890060/header.jpg?t=1769693681","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2890060/68991023/d272c4176b12fde071cf7bddb13ac8ffdd683491/1764673708/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764714330","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2890060/68991023/d272c4176b12fde071cf7bddb13ac8ffdd683491/1764673708/dash_h264.mpd?t=17